== Effects ==
* When Isaac takes damage, spawns a red wisp that fires spectral tears and deals contact damage to enemies (but does not block projectiles). These red wisps last for the entire floor, and Isaac can have up to 6 red wisps at a time.
** Wisps deal <code>3 + 0.1 * (current_floor - 1)</code> damage per tear, and fire tears once per second.
** Wisps deal contact damage equal to 0.5x Isaac's damage per tick (15 ticks per second = 7.5x Isaac's damage).

== Notes ==
* The wisps share the first layer of {{i|Book of Virtues}} wisps, and contribute to filling its cap of 8.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|BFFS!}}: Doubles the wisps' size, on-hit and contact damage.
* {{i|Blood Oath}}: For each half heart of damage taken at the start of the room, a wisp is spawned.

